go run .
NAME:
   workshop - Explore wildlife sightings from GBIF

USAGE:
   workshop [global options] [command [command options]]

COMMANDS:
   sightings, s  Ingest, list and inspect sightings
   species, sp   List and inspect species, which are saved while ingesting sightings
   stats         Show a summary of the saved sightings and species
   animals       List the animals the app recognises and the GBIF taxa behind them
   web, w        Serve the sightings web interface
   db            Manage the database
   help, h       Shows a list of commands or help for one command

GLOBAL OPTIONS:
   --verbose    show debug logs on stderr
   --db string  SQLite database URL (default: "file:workshop.db")
   --live       use the live GBIF and Open-Meteo APIs instead of the bundled mock; they're rate limited
   --help, -h   show help
